WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.535
EXTRACT EPOCH returns the total number of seconds
represented by an interval From

00:00:06.562 --> 00:00:12.289
there you can convert to hours or days The unit you
choose should match

00:00:12.315 --> 00:00:18.006
the analysis A numeric duration is often convenient
for statistics

00:00:18.019 --> 00:00:22.782
or modeling while the interval type can be more
expressive for SQL temporal operations
